# Fixed defect 2442, 2026-11-10, lane b30-pkg, a shape beside it: the
# package `json`'s own catalogue holds a compiler flag. The reader reads a
# package's catalogue as it reads the program's, and its refusal said the
# catalogue holds *nothing but the program's dependencies*, which a
# package's never does: it holds the package's. It now says what any
# catalogue holds.
use <json>/p  #~ package_unread

function main()
    print(p.word())
